00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,900
Slide 25 explores "GOOGLE WORKSPACE INTEGRATION: Connecting your avatar to Drive, Docs, Sheets, and Gmail."

2
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:14,775
Look at our architecture flow: Google Apps Script acts as a lightweight serverless bridge.

3
00:00:14,775 --> 00:00:27,490
When an email arrives with the label "Triage", Apps Script sends a webhook to our cloud engine, parses the payload with Gemini 3.5 Flash, and automatically generates a draft response in Gmail and logs the action to a Google Sheet!

4
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:36,550
Notice that Apps Script runs directly inside Google's infrastructure, requiring zero server maintenance or public IP management.

5
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:46,570
In our code repo, we provide a 20-line Apps Script snippet that handles HMAC authentication and forwards clean JSON to your local or cloud Python agent.

6
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:49,956
You remain fully in control.

7
00:00:49,956 --> 00:00:55,994
The agent drafts the response, but you give the final click to send.

8
00:00:55,994 --> 00:00:57,860
Autonomy with safety.

9
